{"overview":"سریالی پسا آخرالزمانی درام بر پایهٔ سری بازی‌های آخرین بازمانده از ما ساختهٔ ناتی داگ و نویسندگی نیل دراکمن است. داستان در زمانی جریان دارد که قارچی به نام کوردیسپس انسان‌ها را آلوده و آن‌ها را به زامبی‌های خشنی تبدیل کرده است. در این میان جوئل مردی است که موافقت می‌کند تا نوجوانی به نام اِلی را از شهر بوستون خارج کند و به سمت غرب ببرد و به گروهی به نام فایرفلایز تحویل بدهد…","tagline":"","overview_en":"Twenty years after modern civilization has been destroyed, Joel, a hardened survivor, is hired to smuggle Ellie, a 14-year-old girl, out of an oppressive quarantine zone. What starts as a small job soon becomes a brutal, heartbreaking journey, as they both must traverse the United States and depend on each other for survival.","tagline_en":"Every path has a price.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":9,"y":2023,"poster":"/fEImC3QYKuQz5eqJwoBTPIoMUCF.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":7,"y":2025,"poster":"/fPyIEQnySjggaF7aEspUbHIvEEt.jpg"}],"episodes":16,"crew":["Neil Druckmann","کریگ مازن"],"crew_en":["Neil Druckmann","Craig Mazin"],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"بلا رمزی","role":"Ellie Williams","photo":"/vDbgxc7RYawpB1wK7JDEj62j06H.jpg","en":"Bella Ramsey"},{"name":"گابریل لونا","role":"Tommy Miller","photo":"/bIPORtYxTJPEUJIThbZrpqf4A11.jpg","en":"Gabriel Luna"},{"name":"ایزابلا مرسد","role":"Dina","photo":"/7O5GWIH8IHwU4kGZIhC3JkGDiZr.jpg","en":"Isabela Merced"},{"name":"Young Mazino","role":"Jesse","photo":"/cRuVRx1DMe2hBkz5pssVqdpCtaQ.jpg"}],"trailer":"uLtkt8BonwM","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/100088-the-last-of-us/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"HBO Max Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/64fLWeSyZ1KQZhIdvTdy4QHeWty.png"},{"n":"Spectrum On Demand","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/6qPtM96UZkt3Bu4ZFPsDeHFWUZ2.png"},{"n":"HBO Max","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/skypuy7SXuugIQeYg0IglmzoKaS.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV St